  "details": "Currently VCC http request user agent is `VRChat-Package-Manager/vpm-open-beta`\n\nThe Package Manger is not in open beta (anymore)\n\nI would recommend to allign it with VRCHat's api requrement for user-agents\n\n> https://hello.vrchat.com/creator-guidelines\n\n> Applications must identify themselves properly using the User-Agent request header. Use this format: applicationNmae/verion contactInfo. for example VRCAPIApp/1.5.1 contact@example.com. Failing to identify yourself clearly or identifiying yourself improperly will result in moderation action.",
